@title Signup cohort retention
@subtitle How the June to September 2026 cohorts at Mosaic Language Learning keep coming back
@date 2026-10-17

Month-1 retention rose 7 points from the June cohort to the September cohort, from 46 to 53 percent.

kpi Month-1 retention | 50.0% | all four cohorts
kpi Month-2 retention | 40.6% | Jun to Aug
kpi Month-3 retention | 34.1% | Jun and Jul
kpi New users | 95,200 | Jun to Sep

